{"4268530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bingo!", "steam_appid": 4268530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Bingo! 🎮</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a colorful, stylized, and enjoyable 3D bingo-style game that combines chance, strategy, and fun for people of all ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with friends or online players and experience the thrill of friendly competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for short games or longer sessions with friends, the game is designed to be easy to learn and fun 😄✨</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you play online or offline, every match brings laughter, surprises, and excitement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268530/extras/0aeb3313607e3e49c45dacee0c4403f5.poster.avif?t=1769169469\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268530/extras/0aeb3313607e3e49c45dacee0c4403f5.webm?t=1769169469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268530/extras/0aeb3313607e3e49c45dacee0c4403f5.mp4?t=1769169469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a colorful, stylized, and enjoyable 3D bingo-style game that combines chance, strategy, and fun for people of all ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with friends or online players and experience the thrill of friendly competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for short games or longer sessions with friends, the game is designed to be easy to learn and fun 😄✨</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you play online or offline, every match brings laughter, surprises, and excitement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268530/extras/f15a5eb6bde7e00fede0765b34142430.poster.avif?t=1769169469\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268530/extras/f15a5eb6bde7e00fede0765b34142430.webm?t=1769169469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to 4 players in exciting online matches or create private rooms to compete with your friends! 🏠🌐</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our lobby-based system ensures seamless matchmaking, so you can join games instantly and effortlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're across the table or on the other side of the world, the fun and excitement remain the same. 🌍💬</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also includes a single-player mode with bots, so you can practice or enjoy a quick match anytime, anywhere. 🤖🎯</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268530/extras/0bb13eb1bcc3c1d89a565d8e89d4da6d.poster.avif?t=1769169469\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268530/extras/0bb13eb1bcc3c1d89a565d8e89d4da6d.webm?t=1769169469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268530/extras/0bb13eb1bcc3c1d89a565d8e89d4da6d.mp4?t=1769169469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express yourself with a variety of emojis and in-game text chat! 😎🎉</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >React to opponent moves, celebrate your victories, or have fun chats while the game is in progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emojis make every match lively and social by providing quick reactions and fun interactions. 💌✨</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even in single-player matches, fun visual expressions and animations keep the game vibrant and immersive. 🎨🎭</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268530/extras/954fe7d3908c3e039bf26230ad31435f.poster.avif?t=1769169469\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268530/extras/954fe7d3908c3e039bf26230ad31435f.webm?t=1769169469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268530/extras/954fe7d3908c3e039bf26230ad31435f.mp4?t=1769169469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock <strong>superpowers</strong> by discovering special numbers! 🌟💥<br>Powers include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adding extra tokens to your card</strong> ➕🟢</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Changing numbers on your card</strong> 🔄</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Returning opponents’ tokens to the box</strong> 🟥⬅️<br>Using powers strategically adds <strong>an extra layer of strategy and unpredictability</strong>, making each match unique and exciting.<br>⚠️ These powers <strong>may evolve or change</strong> as the game develops, introducing new challenges and keeping gameplay fresh. 🔮✨<br>Mastering powers and timing them correctly can <strong>turn the tide of the game</strong>, keeping every session <strong>engaging and competitive</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268530/extras/3d9a633fcd0bfc17504c4c24e7be0a21.poster.avif?t=1769169469\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268530/extras/3d9a633fcd0bfc17504c4c24e7be0a21.webm?t=1769169469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268530/extras/3d9a633fcd0bfc17504c4c24e7be0a21.mp4?t=1769169469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ultimate goal? <strong>Complete all numbers on your card first!</strong> 🏅🎯</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match is a <strong>race of luck, strategy, and clever use of superpowers</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick thinking, smart moves, and a little luck will decide the winner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each session is <strong>fast-paced, fun, and full of surprises</strong>, so no two games are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who will be the champion today? Gather your friends, sharpen your skills, and let the fun begin! 🏆🎉</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Bingo! 🎮</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a colorful, stylized, and enjoyable 3D bingo-style game that combines chance, strategy, and fun for people of all ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with friends or online players and experience the thrill of friendly competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for short games or longer sessions with friends, the game is designed to be easy to learn and fun 😄✨</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you play online or offline, every match brings laughter, surprises, and excitement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class